      "content": "but i feel fine right now... i dont have any bruises or anything weird happening. if i just keep doing what im doing, what's the actual worst case? like is it really that big of a deal if i just wait a month or two to see how it feels before i bother calling the clinic? i'm just worried about the hassle of all the appointments.",
